<Layout
	title="About Me"
	description="Seasoned software architect with expertise in full-stack development and enterprise architecture."
	pubDate={new Date('August 08 2021')}
	heroImage={AboutHeroImage}
>
	<p>
		I'm a seasoned software architect and full-stack engineer with a career spanning over a decade of delivering enterprise-scale applications. My work focuses on strategic software architecture and practical engineering — turning complex business challenges into robust, production-ready systems.
	</p>

	<p>
		My core expertise lies in full-stack development and enterprise software architecture. I design and implement complete application architectures — from data ingestion through to system integration and delivery — ensuring that solutions are scalable, maintainable, and aligned with long-term business goals.
	</p>

	<p>
		On the backend, I specialise in building secure, production-grade REST APIs that meet the rigorous standards of enterprise security and compliance. I bring hands-on experience across major cloud platforms — AWS, Azure, and GCP — as well as on-premise deployment environments, with a consistent focus on enterprise architecture patterns, infrastructure security, and long-term scalability. Whether migrating workloads to the cloud or designing hybrid architectures, I ensure that security and resilience are foundational, not afterthoughts.
	</p>

	<p>
		I have also worked with modern tooling and emerging technologies as they've become relevant on client engagements, applying them pragmatically where they add genuine value rather than adopting them for their own sake.
	</p>

	<p>
		Beyond the technical depth, I am known for translating strategic vision into actionable engineering roadmaps, mentoring cross-functional teams, and leading delivery across complex, multi-stakeholder programmes. I bring strong communication skills, an entrepreneurial drive, and a track record of building collaborative, high-performing engineering cultures.
	</p>
</Layout>
